 "episode_summary": "In this episode of Nutrition Tier Lists, Talon evaluates nine edible seaweeds and algae based on their nutrient profiles per 100g, health benefits, and potential risks. He highlights algae as the original aquatic source of DHA and EPA omega-3 fatty acids and an unmatched source of iodine, while cautioning that recommended daily servings are often much smaller than 100g. Because the entire food group is exceptionally nutrient-dense, every entry lands in B tier or higher, with Chlorella and Spirulina earning the top \u2605 tier.",
